<h1><a name=3D"Item_113_7"></a><span lang=3D"EN-GB">113.7 Correspondance "a=
utorit=E9 proche" pendant l'enregistrement et le stockage<span style=3D"dis=
play:none;mso-hide:all">[//]</span></span></h1>

<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-GB">Le syst=E8me comporte un facili=
tateur pour la recherche d'autorit=E9s. </span></p>

<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-GB">Ceci fonctionne de la fa=E7on s=
uivante&nbsp;: </span></p>

<p class=3D"bullet" style=3D"margin-left:0cm;text-indent:0cm;mso-list:l19 l=
evel1 lfo21; background:transparent"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=3D=
"EN-GB" style=3D"font-family: Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bid=
i-font-family:Symbol"><span style=3D"mso-list:Ignore">=B7<span style=3D"fon=
t:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&n=
bsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=3D"EN-GB">Une cha=EEne d=
e caract=E8re entr=E9e dans le champ autorit=E9 (dans la notice bibliograph=
ique) correspond avec des autorit=E9s existantes.;</span></p>

<p class=3D"bullet" style=3D"margin-left:0cm;text-indent:0cm;mso-list:l19 l=
evel1 lfo21; background:transparent"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=3D=
"EN-GB" style=3D"font-family: Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bid=
i-font-family:Symbol"><span style=3D"mso-list:Ignore">=B7<span style=3D"fon=
t:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&n=
bsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=3D"EN-GB">Si une corresp=
ondance parfaite est trouv=E9e, l'autorit=E9 existante est s=E9lectionn=E9e=
.</span></p>

<p class=3D"bullet" style=3D"margin-left:0cm;text-indent:0cm;mso-list:l19 l=
evel1 lfo21; background:transparent"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=3D=
"EN-GB" style=3D"font-family: Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bid=
i-font-family:Symbol"><span style=3D"mso-list:Ignore">=B7<span style=3D"fon=
t:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&n=
bsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=3D"EN-GB">S'il n'y a pas=
 de correspondance, le syst=E8me cherchera un =E9l=E9ment proche dans le fi=
chier Autorit=E9. Ceci signifie que le syst=E8me se r=E9f=E8re aux autorit=
=E9s qui correspondent le mieux =E0 la cha=EEne de recherche normalis=E9e s=
aisie.<span style=3D"mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp; </span></span></p>

<p class=3D"NoteHeading"><span lang=3D"EN-GB">Note</span></p>

<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-GB">Ceci ne fonctionne que pour les=
 autorit=E9s de type Auteur. </span></p>

<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-GB">Vous devez mettre le param=E8tr=
e =AB&nbsp;V=E9rification des correspondances proches&nbsp;=BB<span style=
=3D"mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp; </span>(seulement les auteurs) =E0 Oui pour ch=
aque base<span style=3D"mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp; </span>dans l'<a href=3D"h=
ttps://sigb.mediaest.re/informer/Informer.Main.cls?Type=3DAFO&amp;Function=
=3D152&amp;Language=3Dfre&amp;Item=3D&amp;Caller=3DVsmart" target=3D"_paren=
t">AFO 152</a>. </span></p>

